## What to deliver

Build the Emberfin sprite sheet up operation by operation until each
`frames/<index>.png` matches the brief and that frame's target: an orange
flare-making predator drawn in each of its 32×32 frames — swimming down, up, left,
and right (two frames each), and the charge-up-to-flare-bloom animation. When you
are satisfied, stop: the recorded per-frame action logs are your finished
submission.
